(i)  $C_{(graphite)} + O_{2(g)} \to CO_{2(g)}$; $\Delta$_{r}$H^{o}$ = x kJ mol^{ - 1}

(ii)  $C_{(graphite)} + \frac{1}{2} O_{2(g)} \to CO_{(g)}$; $\Delta$_{r}$H^{o}$ = y kJ mol^{ - 1}

(iii)  $CO_{(g)} + \frac{1}{2} O_{2(g)} \to CO_{2(g)}$; $\Delta$_{r}$H^{o}$ = z kJ mol^{$-$1}

Based on the above equations, find out which of the relationship given below is correct.

